M52XQ: qrtrqmi: mobile data on SIM 2 (subscription 1)

gprs atoms for both subscriptions: every WDS client is bound to its subscription (0x00AF, u32, 1 = SIM 1, 2 = SIM 2), the
premux links are shared, the NAS serving system (ignores the binding) is not used for SIM 2 and an explicit attach is not
requested there. The modem data subscription (DDS) is switched outside ofono (m52xq-dds).

